# Model artifacts are tracked (small enough for hackathon)
# Runtime state — regenerated by the app, must not be committed.
# The learning log in particular was committed with 13,097 rows in which the
# "prediction" was the ground-truth value, which made the dashboard's live
# accuracy metrics meaningless.
backend.log
data/processed/learning_log.csv
data/active_alerts.json

# Presentation decks — large binaries kept local. The Namma Route deck is ~54 MB,
# which would sit above GitHub's large-file warning and nearly double the repo.
*.pptx
